---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about HabitTrack — a fast, private, offline-first monthly habit tracker built with zero cloud dependencies and client-side IndexedDB storage."
>
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <!-- Hero Card -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-purple-950/60 text-indigo-700 dark:text-purple-300 border border-indigo-100 dark:border-purple-800/60 mb-4">
        <span>🎯</span>
        <span>Minimalist & Focused</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-50 tracking-tight">
        About HabitTrack
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/80 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        HabitTrack was created with one simple conviction: building daily consistency shouldn't require complex signups, monthly subscriptions, cloud syncing delays, or intrusive notifications.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Pillars Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-indigo-200 dark:hover:border-purple-700/60 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-indigo-600 dark:text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-4">
          🔒
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100 mb-2">100% Client-Side Privacy</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-300/90 leading-relaxed">
          No sign-ups, no cookies, no tracking telemetry, and no remote servers. All your daily habits stay strictly on your device inside your browser's IndexedDB.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-indigo-200 dark:hover:border-purple-700/60 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-indigo-600 dark:text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-4">
          ⚡
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100 mb-2">Instantaneous Speed</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-300/90 leading-relaxed">
          Built using lightweight Astro and Dexie.js. Zero network round-trips mean marking a habit or toggling a month takes 0 milliseconds with immediate tactile feedback.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-indigo-200 dark:hover:border-purple-700/60 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-indigo-600 dark:text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-4">
          📶
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100 mb-2">Offline Ready PWA</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-300/90 leading-relaxed">
          Install it directly to your home screen on iOS, Android, macOS, or Windows. Works seamlessly whether you are on an airplane, subway, or off the grid.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Philosophy Section -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-6">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">
          The Monthly Grid Advantage
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/85 leading-relaxed">
          Traditional streak-based habit apps are notoriously fragile. Missing a single day resets a 60-day counter back to zero, creating unnecessary guilt and motivating users to give up entirely.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/85 leading-relaxed">
          HabitTrack treats every month as a fresh canvas of 28 to 31 days. You get to visualize your consistency across the month at a glance, celebrate real momentum, and recover gracefully from missed days without arbitrary penalties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-purple-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">
          Under the Hood
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/85 leading-relaxed">
          We believe in software that respects your hardware, battery life, and privacy:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#201038] border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-purple-800/40">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">Astro.js Static Engine</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-purple-300/80 mt-1">
              Guarantees minimal DOM size, instant page generation, and top-tier SEO scores.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#201038] border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-purple-800/40">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">IndexedDB via Dexie</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-purple-300/80 mt-1">
              High-performance transactional local database storing separate normalized habit and day-log records.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#201038] border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-purple-800/40">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">Tailwind CSS v4</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-purple-300/80 mt-1">
              Zero runtime CSS overhead, styled with custom light and dark purple colorways.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#201038] border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-purple-800/40">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">Recharts Visualization</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-purple-300/80 mt-1">
              Smooth, touch-friendly area charts plotting your daily scores with zero lag.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-purple-900/40 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 bg-indigo-50/50 dark:bg-purple-950/30 -mx-6 -mb-6 sm:-mx-8 sm:-mb-8 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-b-2xl">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">Ready to build your consistency?</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-300 mt-0.5">Jump straight into this month's tracker. No registration needed.</p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-700 dark:bg-purple-600 dark:hover:bg-purple-500 text-white font-semibold text-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-sm transition-colors"
        >
          <span>Open Tracker</span>
          <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
